  "content": "<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1135/762/banner-png.png\"></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>⚠重要通知：自2026年1月8日起，Heycronus团队的所有项目将正式通过devHeycronus账号在CurseForge、Modrinth和Planet Minecraft平台独家发布与维护。</strong></p><p><strong>马里奥矿车 🏎️✨</strong></p><p>用<strong>马里奥矿车</strong>纹理为你的《我的世界》体验增添趣味！现在，你的矿车将变身为<strong>马里奥赛车</strong>中马里奥的标志性座驾。🚗💨 在轨道上疾驰时，感受风驰电掣的竞速快感！🌟🏁</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fbusiness%253dLAEZJ6TS7CYP6%2526no_recurring%253d0%2526item_name%253dHelp%2bme%2bcontinue%2bwith%2bthe%2bprojects%2bwith%2ba%2bsimple%2bdonation%2b-%2bHeycronus%2526currency_code%253dUSD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"font-weight:400;display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1013293/description_41c410a1-3705-48e1-9d6d-faca354f3234.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"248\" height=\"93\"></a></p><p>🔧&nbsp;<strong>重要提示：</strong>需安装<strong>OptiFine</strong>才能正常使用！🔥</p><p>准备好开启充满乐趣与怀旧情怀的旅程吧！🎮✨</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1291/574/sem-tatulo-2-png.png\"></p>",
